'''Chatty''' is a [[Treebles|treeble]] [[Non-Playable-Character|NPC]] that can be found at [[Camp Chatty]], located in the [[Greenwood Forest]]. Chatty, along with [[Robbie]], are the official mascots of ''[[Free Realms]]''.

